i# Day 02 - Jenkins Installation

## Overview

This module covers the complete installation and initial configuration of Jenkins on Linux and AWS EC2.

The focus is on:

- Java Installation

- Jenkins Installation

- Linux Service Management

- Initial Jenkins Setup

- Plugin Installation

- Administrator User Creation

- Security Basics

- Backup Awareness

- Production Readiness

Your internal Jenkins workbook defines Day02 around Jenkins installation, Java, package management, service validation, initial administrator setup, and plugin configuration.

