By the end of this module, you should be able to:

- Install Java for Jenkins

- Install Jenkins on Ubuntu Linux

- Start Jenkins service

- Stop Jenkins service

- Restart Jenkins service

- Enable Jenkins after reboot

- Access Jenkins UI

- Retrieve the initial administrator password

- Complete first-time Jenkins setup

- Install recommended plugins

- Create Jenkins administrator user

- Verify Jenkins installation

- Understand Jenkins home directory

- Understand Jenkins service files

- Apply basic Jenkins security practices

