## Why This Module Is Important

Without proper installation:

- Jenkins cannot start

- Plugins may fail

- Builds may fail

- Agents cannot connect

- Web UI remains inaccessible

- Upgrades become difficult

- Recovery becomes harder

A strong installation foundation prevents many future CI/CD problems.

