## Jenkins Home Directory

Common Location:

/var/lib/jenkins

Contains:

- Jobs

- Plugins

- Credentials Metadata

- Configuration Files

- Workspaces

- Build History

Important:

Never delete Jenkins Home without a backup.

## Security Considerations

Before exposing Jenkins:

- Change default administrator settings

- Restrict port access

- Configure authentication

- Install only required plugins

- Review user permissions

- Protect credentials

- Back up Jenkins configuration

## AWS EC2 Deployment Notes

If using Jenkins on EC2:

Allow:

Port 8080

For Jenkins UI Access

Allow:

Port 22

For SSH Access

Restrict source IPs wherever possible.

Avoid:

0.0.0.0/0 access for administration in production.

